# Reader FAQ

## What does the reader return?

It returns markdown, plain text, metadata, links, images, chunks, and warnings.

## Can it read dynamic pages?

Static HTML is handled directly. Dynamic pages can request a browser-rendered snapshot.

## How are citations represented?

Links can be preserved inline or summarized in a reference footer.
